The UserMembers classes are designed to manage user account information and interactions within the DuckDuckDefer application.
Each subclass represents a different type of user account: Admin, Faculty, Proctor, and Student. These classes have certain methods that are restricted to those account actions, and also inherit from the parent class UserMembersClass common properties and methods shared among all user types.
Below is a guide for front end developers on how to utilize these classes.


